{"title":"Electrified Rock","slug":"Electrified_Rock","pageid":1564,"revid":19077,"timestamp":"2025-08-09T22:25:16Z","lastEditor":"LOLNM05","categories":["Stone","Ores"],"infobox":{"type":"Stone","fields":[{"label":"Stone","value":"$25/stud"},{"label":"Refined","value":"$30/stud"},{"label":"Forged","value":"$35/stud"},{"label":"Version Added","value":"v1.36.0"},{"label":"Date Added","value":"11/08/2023"},{"label":"Status","value":"Obtainable"}]},"sections":[{"id":"description","text":"Description"},{"id":"trivia","text":"Trivia"}],"body":"<div lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n\n<h2 id=\"description\">Description</h2>\n<p><b>Electrified Stone</b>, like <b><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Electrified_Tree/\">Electrified Trees</a></b>, can be obtained if a <b>lightning bolt</b> strikes a <b><span data-unresolved=\"1\">stone vein</span></b>.\n</p><p>This stone type emits miniature lightning particles, similarly to <b><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Electrified_Tree/\">Electrified Trees</a></b>.\n</p>\n<h2 id=\"trivia\">Trivia</h2>\n<ul><li>Before a patch on an unknown date, when mined, instead of being titled \"<b>Electrified Rock</b>\", it had the title \"<b>electrified_rock</b>\".<figure typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"> \t<span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Example of an Electrified Rock vein in the shape of a tree, discovered by NovaKane in July of 2024.\">Example of an Electrified Rock vein in the shape of a tree, discovered by NovaKane in July of 2024.</span> \t<noscript><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Example of an Electrified Rock vein in the shape of a tree, discovered by NovaKane in July of 2024.\">Example of an Electrified Rock vein in the shape of a tree, discovered by NovaKane in July of 2024.</span></noscript> \t<figcaption> \t\t \t\t\t<span data-unresolved=\"1\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></span> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p>Electrified Rock Tree</p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure></li>\n<li>Despite the odds of lightning striking a stone being <b>drastically</b> rarer due to the scarcity of rocks compared to trees, they are valued <b>much</b> less than <b><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Electrified_Tree/\">Electrified Trees</a>.</b></li>\n<li>Players, especially beginners, could easily get the <b>Forged</b> version of <b>Electrified Stone</b> confused with the <b>Forged</b> version of <b><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Sand/\">Sand</a></b>.</li>\n<li>In update 1.60.0, new rock generation was added, one such being the Stone Tree where the rock formation forms into a tree. There has only been one notable recording of such, and is an <b>Electrified Rock</b> tree.</li></ul>\n<figure typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"> \t<span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Electrified Rock in the mine?\">Electrified Rock in the mine?</span> \t<noscript><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Electrified Rock in the mine?\">Electrified Rock in the mine?</span></noscript> \t<figcaption> \t\t \t\t\t<span data-unresolved=\"1\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></span> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p>Electrified Rock in the mine?</p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n\n</div>"}
